+| **Main workflow core** | The part of the main workflow every project reads whole, at every start, resume and calibration: the roles and the division of labour, the founding rules, the loop's shape, escalation and reporting, project state, and the standing rules that hold in every phase. It is not an extension point; no conditional workflow changes it. It is `supervisor.md`; the phase modules are files of their own under `workflow/phases/`. |
